<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CZK 735 mln 96 audited net profit.</title>
<headline>Czech CZK 735 mln 96 audited net profit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech confectioner Cokoladovny, majority-owned by a consortium of Swiss Nestle SA and France's Danone SA, said on Monday it posted a 1996 audited net profit of 735 million crowns, up from 516 million the previous year.</p>
</text>
